  "prompt": "How many order lines does an order have on average in each month of 2025? Use the sales table and keep the order lines with an order_date from 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31, both included. Return two columns, in this order: order_month, as the date it holds (the first day of the month), and lines_per_order, the number of order lines divided by the number of different orders (order_id), rounded to 2 decimals with ROUND(x, 2). Return one row per order_month. Any row order is fine.",
